    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116017" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>itchy, scabby, mangy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					7.117
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lysim.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.34
			</span></i>: generally, <i>rough,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.121
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῶρος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδεραστής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῶρ᾽ ἔχε Συρακόσιον</span> is corrupt
			in <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
